# Git
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Build outputs (avoid invalidating cache)
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vuepress/dist

# IDE & OS
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# Docs & misc (not needed in image)
docs
*.md
!data-agent-management/README.md
img
# CI 需保留：Maven checkstyle 依赖 CI/src/checkstyle/checkstyle.xml

# Test & coverage
**/__tests__
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/test-results

# Logs & temp
*.log
*.tmp
.cache

# Docker (avoid recursive copy)
docker-file
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
